# Author list matches the PeakATail manuscript (Amiri Tabat, Bafandeh Zendeh &
# Kaymaz). E. Bafandeh Zendeh added 2026-09-15: he is the paper's second author
# and contributed to the software, work that is not visible in this repository's
# commit history because it was done elsewhere. Confirmed by the PI.
# Further authors will be added as the manuscript's author list grows; keep
# the order here identical to the paper's.
